 class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">样品；标本；样本；模范；范例；示范</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"101870\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>登山家<rp>(</rp><rt>とざんか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>良<rp>(</rp><rt>よ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>い<ruby>見本<rp>(</rp><rt>みほん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>だ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">他是登山者的好榜样。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">見舞い</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">みまい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">探望；慰问；问候；慰问信；问候信；慰问礼物</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"140077\"><ruby>息子<rp>(</rp><rt>むすこ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>見舞<rp>(</rp><rt>みま</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いに<ruby>来<rp>(</rp><rt>き</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>たのですが。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我来拜访我的儿子。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">見舞う</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">みまう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">探望；慰问；看望；问候；袭击；打击；挥拳击打</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"195697\">マグニチュード５の<ruby>地震<rp>(</rp><rt>じしん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>東京<rp>(</rp><rt>とうきょう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>見舞<rp>(</rp><rt>みま</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>った。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">马格尼图德5号地震在东京爆发</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">未満</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">みまん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><s